&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://app.smore.com/n/1ym6qj#bn5h408wfw"&gt;View original newsletter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">bn5h408wfw-bvwmkpynrc</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kramer PTG Meeting - April 28</title><link>https://app.smore.com/n/1ym6qj#b5m8132v16</link><description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Kramer PTG Meeting&lt;/strong&gt; will be held on &lt;strong&gt;Tuesday, April 28, 2026 at 7:00 PM&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong&gt;Kramer Art Room&lt;/strong&gt;. This is an &lt;strong&gt;in-person meeting&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;last meeting of the year&lt;/strong&gt;. Parents and teachers are encouraged to attend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add to Calendar:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Kramer%20PTG%20Meeting&amp;dates=20260428T190000/20260428T200000&amp;details=The%20%2A%2AKramer%20PTG%20Meeting%2A%2A%20will%20be%20held%20on%20%2A%2ATuesday%2C%20April%2028%2C%202026%20at%207%3A00%20PM%2A%2A%20in%20the%20%2A%2AKramer%20Art%20Room%2A%2A.%20This%20is%20an%20%2A%2Ain-person%20meeting%2A%2A%20and%20the%20%2A%2Alast%20meeting%20of%20the%20year%2A%2A.%20Parents%20and%20teacher&amp;location=Kramer%20Art%20Room"&gt;Google Calendar&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="data:text/calendar;charset=utf-8,BEGIN%3AVCALENDAR%0AVERSION%3A2.0%0ABEGIN%3AVEVENT%0ADTSTART%3A20260428T190000%0ADTEND%3A20260428T200000%0ASUMMARY%3AKramer%20PTG%20Meeting%0ADESCRIPTION%3AThe%20%2A%2AKramer%20PTG%20Meeting%2A%2A%20will%20be%20held%20on%20%2A%2ATuesday%2C%20April%2028%2C%202026%20at%207%3A00%20PM%2A%2A%20in%20the%20%2A%2AKramer%20Art%20Room%2A%2A.%20This%20is%20an%20%2A%2Ain-person%20meeting%2A%2A%20and%20the%20%2A%2Alast%20meeting%20of%20the%20year%2A%2A.%20Parents%20and%20teacher%0ALOCATION%3AKramer%20Art%20Room%0AEND%3AVEVENT%0AEND%3AVCALENDAR"&gt;iCal&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href="https://outlook.live.com/calendar/0/deeplink/compose?subject=Kramer%20PTG%20Meeting&amp;startdt=20260428T190000&amp;enddt=20260428T200000&amp;body=The%20%2A%2AKramer%20PTG%20Meeting%2A%2A%20will%20be%20held%20on%20%2A%2ATuesday%2C%20April%2028%2C%202026%20at%207%3A00%20PM%2A%2A%20in%20the%20%2A%2AKramer%20Art%20Room%2A%2A.%20This%20is%20an%20%2A%2Ain-person%20meeting%2A%2A%20and%20the%20%2A%2Alast%20meeting%20of%20the%20year%2A%2A.%20Parents%20and%20teacher&amp;location=Kramer%20Art%20Room"&gt;Outlook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://app.smore.com/n/1ym6qj#b5m8132v16"&gt;View original newsletter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">b5m8132v16-bn6ov51rxw</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Parent Drop-Off and Pick-Up Rules</title><link>https://app.smore.com/n/1ym6qj#bf2gr3k7s7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety reminder for Kramer students:&lt;/strong&gt; Parents must follow drop-off and pick-up rules at all times for student safety. The designated drop-off/pick-up area is marked by a red carpet/path on the sidewalk leading to the school entrance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://app.smore.com/n/1ym6qj#bf2gr3k7s7"&gt;View original newsletter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">bf2gr3k7s7-b72jt3qx5p-bqgrdul4qd</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Spring Conference Meals Thank You</title><link>https://app.smore.com/n/xcvuq#b5m8132v16</link><description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Spring 2026 Conference Meals&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;March 12 &amp;amp; 17&lt;/strong&gt; successfully provided food for teachers during extra-long workdays at Kramer. Thanks to helpers and donors, there was plenty of food, smooth setup/cleanup, and even leftovers. Teachers posted sweet thank-you notes on refrigerators expressing gratitude. Special thanks to Kramer PTG and numerous volunteers including Andrea Bennett-Kenne, Jessica Brechin, Tomoko Brown, Jennifer Bulanda, and many others. Coordinators: &lt;strong&gt;Lois Meade &amp;amp; Tomoko Brown&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
