&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talawanda Craft Fair&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;April 25, 2026&lt;/strong&gt; from &lt;strong&gt;9 AM - 2 PM&lt;/strong&gt; at Talawanda Middle School (4030 Reily Oxford Road). Features home decor, jewelry, crafts, beauty products, baked goods, knitted items, and vintage clothes. &lt;strong&gt;$2 entry fee&lt;/strong&gt;. Hosted by Talawanda Volleyball &amp;amp; Cheer Teams.&lt;/p&gt;
