&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;K-Mart Event (3rd-5th Grade):&lt;/strong&gt; Every Monday and Friday, a K-Mart featuring fidgets, snacks, and toys (everything $1) is open from when students walk in until the bell rings. Located at the balcony between 4th and 5th grade. &lt;strong&gt;Opens February 9th&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact: Maureen Kelly (kellym@talawanda.org)&lt;/p&gt;
